# The Hotel Cielo, Isla Soberana: the Family's casino, as Havana had them in the 1950s. Its manager, Lenny Vance, takes the
# calls. (Fiction: nobody here is a real person.)
#
# Reads and acts through Talk.State: {{cs_*}} fields and buy_stake(), collect(), launder(), pay_general(), buy_out(), evacuate().

~ start
if not casino
	Radio: No answer at the Cielo. Perhaps there is nothing to ring.
	=> END
if cs_status == "seized"
	=> seized
if cs_status == "uprising"
	=> uprising
=> greet

~ greet
if cs_trading
	{{manager}}: [[Hotel Cielo, Lenny Vance. The house is full tonight.|Lenny. You've caught me between a headliner and a high roller.|Vance. What can the Cielo do for a friend of the Family?]]
else
	{{manager}}: The house is dark for now. {{cs_dark_note}}
=> talk

~ talk
- Buy a tenth of the house. ({{money_s(cs_stake_price)}}, you hold {{cs_stake_pct}}%) [if cs_can_buy]
	do buy_stake()
	if result != ""
		{{manager}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{manager}}: Mr. Moretti will be pleased. You hold {{cs_stake_pct}}% of the Cielo now.
	=> talk
- Collect your share. ({{money_s(cs_owed)}} in the account) [if cs_owed > 0]
	do collect()
	if result != ""
		{{manager}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{manager}}: A cheque, drawn on a bank that does not exist. Cash it quickly.
	=> talk
- Put street cash through the cage. ({{cs_cash_line}}) [if cs_has_cash]
	do launder()
	if result != ""
		{{manager}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{manager}}: Chips in, cheque out. Nobody counts chips twice. {{cs_launder_line}}
	=> talk
- Pay the General's aide. ({{money_s(cs_general_payoff)}})
	do pay_general()
	if result != ""
		{{manager}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{manager}}: Envelopes keep an island calm. For a while.
	=> talk
- Buy out {{cs_rival_name}}. ({{money_s(cs_rival_buyout)}}) [if cs_rival > 30 and not cs_bought_out]
	do buy_out()
	if result != ""
		{{manager}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{manager}}: Varga took the money and the first boat. The tables are ours.
	=> talk
- "How is the house doing?"
	=> word
- That's all.
	{{manager}}: [[Come and see the show.|The Cielo never closes.|Mind the General's people on the way out.]]
	=> END

~ word
{{manager}}: The house takes about {{money_s(cs_gross_hour)}} an hour on a good night. The General's people skim {{cs_skim_pct}}%, the Family {{cs_family_pct}}%; your share is {{money_s(cs_share_hour)}} an hour.
if cs_act != ""
	{{manager}}: And {{cs_act}} on the bill: the tourists are in.
if cs_rival > 60
	{{manager}}: {{cs_rival_name}} is leaning on us. Varga's boys were in the kitchens again yesterday.
if cs_heat > 60
	{{manager}}: The gaming commission has been asking about the cage. I would go easy on it for a few days.
if cs_unrest > 70
	{{manager}}: (lower) The cabbies say there are men in the hills. The old general's days are numbered, and so are ours if we stay.
elif cs_unrest > 40
	{{manager}}: The bellhops have started reading newspapers in the lobby. That is never good.
=> talk

~ uprising
{{manager}}: (shouting over gunfire) They are in the street! The government is gone! There is a launch at the harbour, {{cs_uprising_min}} minutes, and then nothing!
- Get out on the launch. ({{money_s(cs_evac_total)}} comes with you)
	do evacuate()
	if result != ""
		{{manager}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{manager}}: Go. Go! Viva... whatever they are shouting now.
	=> END
- Stay and hold the house.
	{{manager}}: (a crash) Then God help you. Nobody is coming.
	=> END

~ seized
{{manager}}: [[(a stranger's voice) The Hotel Cielo is the property of the People.|(static) The casino has been nationalised.]]
Radio: Nothing more from the island.
=> END
